## OBJECTIVE

Perform a complete inspection, debugging, and correction of the existing College Portal application.

Several modules currently have duplicate records, incorrect fee displays, poorly formatted PDF receipts, and non-functional leave applications. The student fee payment interface also needs to be improved with a complete demonstration payment gateway.

**Your primary responsibility is to FIX the existing implementation, not create a separate application or rebuild the entire project from scratch.**

Inspect the existing frontend, backend, database schema, API endpoints, authentication, and state management before making changes.

Preserve the existing design system, navigation, user roles, database relationships, and all correctly functioning features.

Implement the following fixes completely, ensuring that the changes work across the frontend, backend, and database.

