8. Generate the final receipt only after successful payment.
9. Prevent unauthorized access to other students' payment records.
10. Record payment timestamps using a consistent backend time standard and display them in the appropriate local timezone.

Use the application's existing authentication and authorization mechanisms.

## E. Payment Processing Screen

